<% content_for :title, "About" %>

<div class="row justify-content-center">
  <div class="col-lg-8">
    <h1 class="h2 mb-4">About Swapper</h1>

    <h2 class="h5 mt-4">What it is</h2>
    <p>Swapper helps organizations with many locations handle employee transfer requests. When two people
       doing the same job each want to work where the other one is, they can simply trade places. Swapper finds those
       pairs automatically and gives HR a clear workflow to approve and complete them.</p>

    <h2 class="h5 mt-4">Why it matters</h2>
    <p>Transfer requests usually live in spreadsheets, emails and paper forms. Matches get missed, employees wait
       months, and some leave for an employer closer to home. A one-for-one swap keeps both locations fully staffed
       while giving two employees what they asked for.</p>

    <h2 class="h5 mt-4">Who can do what</h2>
    <table class="table table-sm bg-white border">
      <thead><tr><th>Role</th><th>Can</th></tr></thead>
      <tbody>
        <tr><td>Employee</td><td>Sign in, choose a desired location, see the status of their request.</td></tr>
        <tr><td>Manager</td><td>Everything above, plus add/import employees and review, approve and complete matches.</td></tr>
        <tr><td>HR Admin</td><td>Everything above, plus manage locations, invite staff, set roles and view the activity log.</td></tr>
      </tbody>
    </table>

    <h2 class="h5 mt-4">Contact</h2>
    <p><%= mail_to ENV.fetch("CONTACT_EMAIL", "kylebelfance@gmail.com") %></p>
  </div>
</div>
